    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82903" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πήδ-ησις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>leaping</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πηδήσεις σατυρικαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					75
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πηδήσεις ἐπὶ τοὺς ἵππους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>Tact.</u>
					43.3
				</span></i>
			; of wood burning, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Ign.</u>
				69
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>beating</i> or <i>throbbing</i> of the heart, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				70c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lg.</u>
				791a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				669a20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Ir</u>
				p.27
			</span></i> W.</div>
